We couldn't hang out in the house because my @CAPS3 had a cold, so we had to go outside to the shop, which is also called a garage, and hang out together until @PERSON2 and @PERSON4 got @NUM1. Finally, they showed up, and I didn't feel as sick as I thought I would when she got there. She got out of the car, and we went straight to the shop and got started on trying to find something to do.

