@CAPS1 showed everyone her dance and the song; everybody laughed so hard I thought they were gonna pass out. I had a lot of fun that night mostly because of @CAPS1. She was very nice; she was funny, and she kept me thinking about other things than what was on my mind at the time. @CAPS1 was a big ball of hyper that night, I thought that it was funny. We were just standing there in the shed, and she goes "mouse" and I scream and jump up onto a chair and scream "@CAPS14!" @CAPS1 reassures me that it was in the rafters and couldn't come down and get us. So for the rest of the time, we just acted like it wasn't even there.

