"Laughter is the shortest distance between two people," and this quote could not be truer in the friendship between me and my best friend, @PERSON1. Our friendship started on @DATE1, and now we are in our sophomore year of high school, celebrating one year, eleven months, and six days of being the best of best friends. Some people may think we're weird, but if you knew us, you would understand that laughter is the glue that binds us together. 

