During our trip to State for cheer in @DATE2, we couldn't stop laughing even during the car ride to @LOCATION1. Every time we passed a corner, we would announce which corner it was and do a motion with it. Our favorite was the monkey motion, where we would act like monkeys, and it was so much fun that we laughed until we cried, and we even had to make pee stops. It was one of many car rides where we had an amazing time together. 

